{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Dm3Sa9VkXoGniK4SaXrTAq","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"IANA example domain\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"0% found this document useful (0 votes)\",\"url\":\"https://www.scribd.com/document/873956284/Example-Domains\"},{\"title\":\"20261007 example com\",\"url\":\"https://gigazine.net/gsc_news/en/20261007-example-com/\"},{\"title\":\"www.wikipedia.org\",\"url\":\"https://Www.Wikipedia.org/wiki/.example\"},{\"title\":\"www.example.com - dns.ninja\",\"url\":\"https://dns.ninja/en/dns-lookup/com/example/www\"},{\"title\":\"sid dkrZ7Blj4z\",\"url\":\"https://www.longtermwiki.com/resources/sid_dkrZ7Blj4z\"},{\"title\":\"example dot com redesign history\",\"url\":\"https://www.debugbear.com/blog/example-dot-com-redesign-history\"},{\"title\":\"draft ellermann idnabis test tlds 09\",\"url\":\"https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-ellermann-idnabis-test-tlds-09.html\"},{\"title\":\"www.wikipedia.org\",\"url\":\"https://Www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Example.com\"},{\"title\":\"Internet-Draft Private use top-level domain February 2025\",\"url\":\"https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-davies-internal-tld-02.html\"},{\"title\":\"IANA-managed Reserved Domains\",\"url\":\"https://res-dom.iana.org\"},{\"title\":\"The domains example.com, example.net, and\",\"url\":\"https://kottke.org/02/03/the-domains-examplecom-examplenet-and\"},{\"title\":\"Network Working Group\",\"url\":\"https://pike.lysator.liu.se/docs/ietf/rfc/26/rfc2606.xml\"},{\"title\":\"Example Domains\",\"url\":\"https://www.netify.ai/documentation/agent/concepts/features/applications/catalog/example-domains\"},{\"title\":\"example.com - dns.ninja\",\"url\":\"https://dns.ninja/en/dns-lookup/com/example\"},{\"title\":\"example.com/net/org DNS records\",\"url\":\"https://mailman.nanog.org/pipermail/nanog/2004-January/170645.html\"},{\"title\":\"Internet Assigned Numbers Authority (IANA)\",\"url\":\"https://polaris7.io/compani