 registration or transfer.\n- **Usage:** Writers and developers use them as placeholders in books, tutorials, and code samples. Their own status is also documented: one source describes example.com as a reserved domain name set aside by the Internet Assigned Numbers Authority (IANA) for documentation purposes.\n- **Other reserved names:** The IANA reserves the TLDs \".example\", \".invalid\", \".localhost\", \".test\", \".tld\", and some sources also list example.edu, though I didn't confirm that against an RFC.\n- **Caveat:** A Gigazine article claims IANA has said example.com does not provide HTTP services on example.com for production or monitoring purposes. I couldn't verify this against an IANA source, so treat it with caution. The article is the only result making that claim.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","uuid":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000","timestamp":"2026-11-15T12:39:47.638Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"IANA example domain","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Qpmn7xHE8wPsDA65PfkBFv","content":[{"title":"0% found this document useful (0 votes)","url":"https://www.scribd.com/document/873956284/Example-Domains"},{"title":"20261007 example com","url":"https://gigazine.net/gsc_news/en/20261007-example-com/"},{"title":"www.wikipedia.org","url":"https://Www.Wikipedia.org/wiki/.example"},{"title":"www.example.com - dns.ninja","url":"https://dns.ninja/en/dns-lookup/com/example/www"},{"title":"sid dkrZ7Blj4z","url":"https://www.longtermwiki.com/resources/sid_dkrZ7Blj4z"},{"title":"example dot com redesign history","url":"https://www.debugbear.com/blog/example-dot-com-redesign-history"},{"title":"draft ellermann idnabis test tlds 09","url":"https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-ellermann-idnabis-test-tlds-09.html"},{"title":"www.wikipedia.org","url":"https://Www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Example.com"},{"titl